    "agent_plus_jev": "The scoped judge_evidence tool may load this generic registry. Only admissible retrieved passages and agent-proposed findings enter state. Never insert expected case answers or private evaluator material.",
    "agent_only": "Do not expose this registry or judge_evidence and remove instructions requiring Jev. The agent performs the same semantic work itself using the same admissible research and financial tools.",
